 "notes": "Episode 6 pack atlas, merged into enemies_battle. Base frame <id> facing RIGHT, origin bottom-centre (the default; the `origin` table agrees). Derived <id>_idle_1, _attack, _hurt, _die_0..2 for every id, _cast for gale_sprite, signal_wraith, lightning_manta, gale_engine, storm_page, false_beacon, broken_compass; anims <id>_idle and <id>_die. Draw 1x, untinted. squall_wolf, gale_sprite, rigger_beetle, signal_wraith, storm_harrier, lightning_manta (enemies.png cells 2, 0, 3, 1, 6, 7), gale_engine (cell 4 at 100 px, a fan in the core, bellows on its back), storm_page, false_beacon, broken_compass (drawn in code; the Beacon and the Compass each stand on their own ground shadow). Every foe carries a dark outline and a side rim (cloud white Aloft, brass grounded). The Storm Scribe lives in bosses_battle (see `external`)."
